<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Namsea, Namfish involved in talks.</title>
<headline>Namsea, Namfish involved in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Namibian Sea Products Limited (Namsea) and Namibian Fishing Industries Limited (Namfish) said on Monday talks were in progress which could affect the price of the companies' shares.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their share dealings until a further announcement was made. No further details were given.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
